     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\">here is the code:</span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\">set.seed(2015-12-31)<span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>tr &lt;- rtree(15)<span></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>p &lt;- ggtree(tr)</span></span><code><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:black\"><span></span></span></code></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\">a &lt;- runif(15, 0, 0.33)<span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>b &lt;- runif(15, 0, 0.33)<span></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>c &lt;- runif(15, 0, 0.33)<span></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>d &lt;- 1 - a - b - c<span></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>dat &lt;- data.frame(a=a, b=b, c=c, d=d)<span></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span>## input data should have a column of `node` that store the node number</span></span><code><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span></span></span></code></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\">dat$node &lt;- c(&quot;t1&quot;,&quot;t2&quot;,&quot;t3&quot;,&quot;t4&quot;,&quot;t5&quot;,&quot;t6&quot;,&quot;t7&quot;,&quot;t8&quot;,&quot;t9&quot;,&quot;t10&quot;,&quot;t11&quot;,&quot;t12&quot;,&quot;t13&quot;,&quot;t14&quot;,&quot;t15&quot;)</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:black\"><span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><br></span></span></pre><pre style=\"word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&#39;lucida console&#39;;color:blue\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:zuoyefont_mathfont,&#39;microsoft yahei&#39;,宋体,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,238)\">mistake to push ctrl+enter twice, and the email send automatically, i am sincerely sorry for that.</span><br></span></span></pre></div>"
